      "role": "user",
      "content": "Thanks, that makes sense. Could you expand a bit more on the fee structures? Specifically, I want to make sure I explain to the client why mutual funds sometimes have higher expense ratios and if there are any hidden costs or \"drags\" on performance they should look out for in either type.",
      "source": "evaluator"
